{
  "$meta": {
    "name": "nuankebao-design-tokens",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "暖客宝 UI 设计令牌 单一真相源 (SSOT)。改这里 → 跑 `pnpm tokens:build` → Flutter + Web 两端同步生成。",
    "generatedArtifacts": [
      "flutter_app/lib/core/theme/tokens.g.dart",
      "src/lib/design-tokens.g.ts",
      "src/styles/globals.css (标记注入块)",
      "flutter_app/web/index.html + manifest.json (外科式改 theme-color, 保住其余人工字段)"
    ],
    "neverEdit": [
      "flutter_app/lib/core/theme/tokens.g.dart",
      "src/lib/design-tokens.g.ts",
      "src/styles/globals.css 中 BEGIN/END GENERATED 之间的内容",
      "flutter_app/web/index.html 与 manifest.json 里的 theme-color / background_color / theme_color"
    ],
    "rules": [
      "本文件是唯一允许出现字面 hex 色值的地方 (mermaid classDef 字符串例外, 见 docs/ui-tokens.md §例外)",
      "themes 只覆盖品牌色槽位; 中性色 / 文字色 / 状态色在 shared, 所有主题共用 → 换肤不会让对比度退化",
      "onPrimary / onAccent / onSuccess 等『前景色』一律由生成器按相对亮度自动推导, 手写无效",
      "新增主题 = 往 themes 数组加一项, 然后 pnpm tokens:build (无需改任何业务代码)"
    ]
  },
